Package: airunner
Architecture: amd64
# The frozen onedir runtime carries the pinned Python interpreter and
# CORE dependencies. dh_shlibdeps derives the host shared-library closure
# from the executable; adduser provisions the service account.
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: Headless service daemon for AI Runner (services only)
 The frozen CORE services runtime provides headless orchestration, the
 FastAPI server, runtime registry, downloads, persistence, lifecycle
 control, and daemon health.
 .
 This amd64 services package ships the AIRunner console commands and the
 airunner-headless systemd unit. It contains no Qt desktop client. ML
 model runtimes, weights, and GPU libraries are not included. The daemon
 reports missing-runtime diagnostics when an optional ML runtime is not
 separately provisioned.
